WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.640
You sent your impact report.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.836
Did it land?

3
00:00:02.846 --> 00:00:06.656
Storyraise Analytics shows you who read
it, what held their attention, and who

4
00:00:06.666 --> 00:00:08.874
might be ready to hear from you.

5
00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:12.241
Your Home tab shows what's being read
across all of your reports.

6
00:00:12.251 --> 00:00:16.049
Open any report's Analytics for the full
picture, in two views:

7
00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:19.034
The Numbers, and The Story.

8
00:00:19.044 --> 00:00:22.621
Up top, Constituents Opened counts the
people on your list who opened their

9
00:00:22.631 --> 00:00:27.005
personalized link, and Constituent Returns
shows how many came back.

10
00:00:27.101 --> 00:00:29.935
Views counts every visit, repeats
included.

11
00:00:29.945 --> 00:00:34.045
And Average Time Spent is the average
reader's total time, across all of their

12
00:00:34.055 --> 00:00:35.927
visits.

13
00:00:35.937 --> 00:00:39.201
Highlights do the first read for you, like
when readers peak.

14
00:00:39.211 --> 00:00:43.317
And the map shows roughly where your
audience is reading from.

15
00:00:44.537 --> 00:00:47.018
With personalized links, you see names.

16
00:00:47.114 --> 00:00:50.854
Most Engaged Constituents ranks your
standouts with an Engagement Score.

17
00:00:50.864 --> 00:00:54.720
One star means they read longer than the
typical constituent on this report.

18
00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:58.140
Two stars, they also got through at least
half of it.

19
00:00:58.236 --> 00:01:03.137
Three stars, they took action too, by
clicking a link or coming back.

20
00:01:03.147 --> 00:01:08.850
And badges flag key actions, like a
donation click, even when the stars don't.

21
00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:12.554
Where The Clicks Go groups every link
click by what readers wanted, from

22
00:01:12.564 --> 00:01:14.585
donating to opening a document.

23
00:01:14.595 --> 00:01:15.688
Reading shows attention.

24
00:01:15.698 --> 00:01:17.587
Clicking shows intent.

25
00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.795
How They Read shows how far people get.

26
00:01:21.805 --> 00:01:26.021
Section Retention traces their path from
section to section, and the red edge marks

27
00:01:26.031 --> 00:01:27.507
where visits ended.

28
00:01:27.517 --> 00:01:31.763
A big drop after your opening tells you
exactly what to tighten.

29
00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:37.589
Top Visit Times shows the days and times
of day people actually read, so your next

30
00:01:37.599 --> 00:01:40.672
send can land when your readers show up.

31
00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:44.003
Short on time?

32
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:47.689
The Story sums it all up in plain English,
with people worth a follow-up and ideas

33
00:01:47.699 --> 00:01:50.923
for next time, ready to download and
share.

34
00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:51.772
Remember:

35
00:01:51.782 --> 00:01:54.478
anonymous links tell you how your report
performed.

36
00:01:54.488 --> 00:01:58.222
Personalized links tell you who to call on
Monday.

37
00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:03.454
See every part of it for yourself in the
interactive demo, right here on this page.
